From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: smit1237 <smit1237@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:47:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/22] portal: rnsbox-portal Flask admin UI

Add the rnsbox-portal Buildroot package: an OpenWrt-style Flask web UI on
0.0.0.0:80 for network, Reticulum, WiFi and system settings. It owns the
single-source-of-truth nftables generator (rnsbox_portal.nftgen), stores the
admin password hashed in /etc/rnsbox/auth.json, and generates its Flask
session key at runtime. MIT licensed.
